#==============================================================================================
#
#   style_computer_3 - CSS::StyleComputer: CSS animations
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleComputer.cpp (lines 639-996): collect_animation_into (the
#       interpolated keyframe values at an animation's progress) and
#       process_animation_definitions (CSSAnimations from animation-name and @keyframes).
#
#       The animations are phase 4: the Animations and CSSAnimation/CSSTransition members these
#       functions call are stubs of stubs/stub_closure ("unported (P4)"), and their types are
#       opaque, so an AnimationEffect is reached from its KeyframeEffect (and an Animation from
#       its CSSAnimation or CSSTransition) by a pointer cast, the embedded-base upcast of
#       DESIGN.md §2.3.
#
#       Copyright (c) 2018-2025, Andreas Kling <andreas@ladybird.org>
